    <statement><p>Consider the graphs of <m>f(x)</m> and <m>g(x)</m> below:</p>
<image xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" pi:generated="webwork/images/Library__LoyolaChicago__Precalc__Chap1Sec2__Q06_pg-image-1.png" width="60%"/>
